{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Walleye is a ",["l","鱼","fish"]," that can be caught in the river (in ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"]," or ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],"), the ",["l","深山","mountain Lake"],", and the ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"]," pond during ",["l","秋季","Fall"]," when it is ",["l","天气","raining"],". It can also be caught in ",["l","冬季","Winter"]," if a ",["l","雨水图腾","Rain Totem"]," is used. It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," cat with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],". It can randomly be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s during Fall and Winter, or at the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 315–1,000g. If the player chooses the ",["l","农场地图","Riverland Farm"]," or the ",["l","农场地图","Forest Farm"],", Walleye can also be caught in the farm pond."]],["p",["Walleye can be caught regardless of weather, time, or season using ",["l","魔法鱼饵","Magic Bait"],"."]],["p",["Walleye is most common in the Cindersap Forest pond. Every cast in the pond during raining Fall days has a 32% chance of hooking a Walleye."]]]],["Map",2,[["p",["Walleye can be found in the river, ",["l","深山","mountain lake"],", and ",["l","煤矿森林","forest pond"]," during ",["l","秋季","Fall"]," when it is raining."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维",